  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of elegance and convenience in this stunning, brand-new two-storey home, nestled in the vibrant East Coast Heights community of Silverdale. Currently under construction at the subdivision located on Goldwater Drive and due for completion by the end of the year, this is your chance to secure a premium freehold property in a high-growth location.\r\n\r\nSet on a low-maintenance freehold section, this home offers a generous floor area designed for modern family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nKey Features You'll Love:\r\n\r\n* Non-blocked views with sunny outlooks over the neighbourhood, enhancing light and space\r\n* Four double bedrooms, including a master with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n* Flexible living with open-plan kitchen, dining and living, plus a second lounge ideal for a media room or retreat\r\n* Private outdoor living with a sheltered deck and easy-care backyard, perfect for relaxing or hosting\r\n* Internal-access single garage with laundry nook, plus off-street parking\r\n\r\nEnjoy unbeatable convenience just moments from Pak'nSave, Silverdale Mall, cafes and local amenities. With the Hibiscus Coast Bus Station and motorway access nearby, commuting to Albany and Auckland CBD is simple.\r\n\r\nExcellent school zoning includes Dairy Flat Primary School (Decile 10) and Orewa College.\r\n\r\nThis is a standout opportunity to secure a high-quality, well-located home in a sought-after community.",
